    <briefdescription>
<para>An overloaded function to find and extract a value for a named field. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Find and extract the value for name. The value may be of type real, integer, logical or character. If a single value from an array of values is required, an optional index can be supplied. Return true for success and false for failure <linebreak/>
 Example usage: <programlisting filename=".F90"><codeline><highlight class="normal">success<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="interfacefield__manager__mod_1_1fm__get__value" kindref="compound">fm_get_value</ref>(name,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">value</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>index)</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>    </detaileddescription>
